			"start": 3.45,
			"end": 4.808,
			"en": "Poor Ian!",
			"zh": "可怜的伊恩！"
		},
		{
			"i": 2,
			"start": 6.26,
			"end": 10.638,
			"en": "Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
			"zh": "听录音，然后回答这个问题。"
		},
		{
			"i": 3,
			"start": 12.13,
			"end": 15,
			"en": "Who wanted to sell the house?",
			"zh": "谁想卖掉房子？"
		},
		{
			"i": 4,
			"start": 17.55,
			"end": 20.283,
			"en": "Has Ian sold his house yet?",
			"zh": "伊恩把他的房子卖了吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 5,
			"start": 21.25,
			"end": 22.93,
			"en": "Yes, he has.",
			"zh": "是的，他卖了。"
		},
		{
			"i": 6,
			"start": 23.21,
			"end": 25.58,
			"en": "He sold it last week.",
			"zh": "他上周卖的。"
		},
		{
			"i": 7,
			"start": 26.92,
			"end": 30.412,
			"en": "Has he moved to his new house yet?",
			"zh": "他搬到新家了吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 8,
			"start": 31.45,
			"end": 33.362,
			"en": "No, not yet.",
			"zh": "不，还没有。"
		},
		{
			"i": 9,
			"start": 33.81,
			"end": 35.415,
			"en": "He's still here.",
			"zh": "他还在这儿。"
		},
		{
			"i": 10,
			"start": 36.05,
			"end": 38.711,
			"en": "He's going to move tomorrow.",
			"zh": "他明天就要搬家了。"
		},
		{
			"i": 11,
			"start": 39.82,
			"end": 42.712,
			"en": "When? Tomorrow morning?",
			"zh": "什么时候？明天早上吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 12,
			"start": 44.12,
			"end": 47.044,
			"en": "No. Tomorrow afternoon.",
			"zh": "不，明天下午。"
		},
		{
			"i": 13,
			"start": 47.83,
			"end": 49.213,
			"en": "I'll miss him.",
			"zh": "我会想念他的。"
		},
		{
			"i": 14,
			"start": 49.89,
			"end": 53.513,
			"en": "He has always been a good neighbour.",
			"zh": "他一直是个好邻居。"
		},
		{
			"i": 15,
			"start": 54.57,
			"end": 57.425,
			"en": "He's a very nice person.",
			"zh": "他是个很好的人。"
		},
		{
			"i": 16,
			"start": 58.17,
			"end": 60.743,
			"en": "We'll all miss him.",
			"zh": "我们都会想念他的。"
		},
		{
			"i": 17,
			"start": 62.21,
			"end": 66.46,
			"en": "When will the new people move into this house?",
			"zh": "新住户什么时候搬进这所房子？"
		},
		{
			"i": 18,
			"start": 67.54,
			"end": 72.733,
			"en": "I think that they'll move in the day after tomorrow.",
			"zh": "我想他们会在后天搬进来。"
		},
		{
			"i": 19,
			"start": 74.22,
			"end": 77.924,
			"en": "Will you see Ian today, Jenny?",
			"zh": "珍妮，你今天会见到伊恩吗？"
		},
		{
			"i": 20,
			"start": 79.71,
			"end": 81.55,
			"en": "Yes, I will.",
			"zh": "是的，我会的。"
		},
		{
			"i": 21,
			"start": 83.09,
			"end": 86.672,
			"en": "Please give him my regards.",
			"zh": "请代我向他问好。"
		},
		{
			"i": 22,
			"start": 87.83,
			"end": 93.255,
			"en": "Poor Ian! He didn't want to leave this house.",
			"zh": "可怜的伊恩！他不想离开这所房子。"
		},
		{
			"i": 23,
			"start": 94.49,
			"end": 95.347,
			"en": "No, he didn't want to leave, but his wife did!",
			"zh": "不，他不想走，但是他妻子想！"
		}
	]
